  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLet's check each option one by one:\n\n**Given equation:** 45 - 33 ÷ 3 × 4 + 67 = 22\n\n**Option 1) ÷ and ×**\n\n**After interchanging ÷ and ×:**\n\n45 - 33 × 3 ÷ 4 + 67 = 22\n\n45 - (33 × 3) ÷ 4 + 67 = 22\n\n45 - 99 ÷ 4 + 67 = 22\n\n45 - 24.75 + 67 = 22\n\n20.25 + 67 = 22\n\n87.25 ≠ 22\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) − and +**\n\n**After interchanging − and +:**\n\n45 + 33 ÷ 3 × 4 - 67 = 22\n\n45 + (33 ÷ 3) × 4 - 67 = 22\n\n45 + 11 × 4 - 67 = 22\n\n45 + 44 - 67 = 22\n\n89 - 67 = 22\n\n22 = 22\n\nLHS = RHS\n\n**Option 3) − and ×**\n\n**After interchanging − and ×:**\n\n45 × 33 ÷ 3 - 4 + 67 = 22\n\n(45 × 33) ÷ 3 - 4 + 67 = 22\n\n1485 ÷ 3 - 4 + 67 = 22\n\n495 - 4 + 67 = 22\n\n491 + 67 = 22\n\n558 ≠ 22\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) + and ×**\n\n**After interchanging + and ×:**\n\n45 - 33 ÷ 3 + 4 × 67 = 22\n\n45 - (33 ÷ 3) + (4 × 67) = 22\n\n45 - 11 + 268 = 22\n\n34 + 268 = 22\n\n302 ≠ 22\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option (****2)\".**",
